{
  "format": "mysim",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "MyCircuit circuits simulated as they are",
  "description": "Three netlists from MyCircuit's \"Export SPICE\" (a non-inverting op-amp amplifier, an NPN transistor switch, a half-wave rectifier) solved as they are, with subcircuits, B sources, a BJT and diode models. Opening a .mycircuit project makes the same node.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "amp",
      "type": "circuit.spice",
      "name": "Non-inverting amplifier (MyCircuit)",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 50,
      "params": {
        "netlist": "Non-inverting amplifier (gain 11) - generated by MyCircuit\nV1 _12V 0 DC 12\nV2 0 _12V_ DC 12\nV3 IN 0 DC 0 SIN(0 0.5 1000 0 0 0)\nXU1 IN FB OUT _12V _12V_ OPAMP_U1\nR2 FB OUT 100000\nR3 FB 0 10000\nR1 OUT 0 10000\n\n.subckt OPAMP_U1 inp inn out vp vn\nB1 out 0 V=max(min(100000*(V(inp)-V(inn)), V(vp)), V(vn))\n.ends\n\n.tran 2u 3m\n.end\n",
        "probes": "in, out"
      },
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sw",
      "type": "circuit.spice",
      "name": "NPN switch (MyCircuit)",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 330,
      "params": {
        "netlist": "NPN transistor switch - generated by MyCircuit\nVBT1 VCC 0 DC 4.5\nRSW1 VCC SW_OUT 0.01 ; switch closed\nR2 SW_OUT BASE 10000\nR3 BASE 0 100000\nQ1 LED_K BASE 0 Q_Q1\nR1 VCC Net-_D1-Pad2_ 220\nD1 Net-_D1-Pad2_ LED_K D_D1\n\n.model Q_Q1 NPN(IS=6.7e-15 BF=200 BR=2)\n.model D_D1 D(IS=1e-19 N=1.8 RS=10)\n\n.op\n.end\n",
        "probes": ""
      },
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "rect",
      "type": "circuit.spice",
      "name": "Half-wave rectifier (MyCircuit)",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 610,
      "params": {
        "netlist": "Half-wave rectifier - generated by MyCircuit\nV1 AC_IN 0 DC 0 SIN(0 12 50 0 0 0)\nD1 AC_IN VOUT D_D1\nC1 VOUT 0 0.00047\nR1 VOUT 0 1000\n\n.model D_D1 D(IS=2.52e-9 N=1.752)\n\n.tran 100u 100m\n.end\n",
        "probes": ""
      },
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "out.plot",
      "name": "Chart",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 50,
      "params": {
        "chart": "line",
        "logX": false,
        "logY": false,
        "equal": false,
        "span": "2",
        "title": "Amplifier: in and out (V)",
        "table": "transient",
        "y": "V(in), V(out)"
      },
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "out.plot",
      "name": "Chart",
      "x": 320,
      "y": 330,
      "params": {
